layout_mode = 2
size_flags_vertical = 3
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[center][b]Your Mission:[/b][/center]

Protect your network by detecting tampered files using cryptographic hashing.

[b]What is Hashing?[/b]
Hashing converts data into a fixed-length value. The same input always produces the same hash, but even a tiny change produces a completely different hash.

[b][color=yellow]Key Principle:[/color][/b]
[i]\"If data changes, its hash changes — that's how we detect tampering.\"[/i]"
fit_content = true

